        {
          "text": "Mĩthenya yonthe ya wĩvĩto wake wa kwĩvathan’ya, wenzi ndũkaavike mũtwe wake: kũvika yĩla mĩthenya yĩĩanĩa, ĩla wevathanisye ethĩwe wa Yeova, akeethĩwa e mũtheu; akaeke nzw’ĩĩ sya mũtwe wake iasave. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
