        {
          "text": "Na ethĩwa mũndũ o na wĩva akatũmũkĩa vakuvĩ nake, na akavukya mũtwe wa kwĩvatha kwake; nĩvo ĩndĩ wĩenza mũtwe wake mũthenya wa kwĩthesya kwake, mũthenya wa mũonza akawenze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
