          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na mũthembi akathembe ĩmwe yĩthĩwe nthembo kwondũ wa naĩ, na ĩla ĩngĩ yĩthĩwe nthembo ya kũvĩvw’a, amwĩw’anĩthye, nũndũ nĩwavĩtisye nũndũ wa kimba, na akavathan’ye mũtwe wake mũthenya o ũsu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nake akamũvathĩa Yeova mĩthenya ya kwĩvatha kwake, na akaete katũlũme ka mwaka ũmwe kethĩwe nthembo kwondũ wa ĩvĩtyo: ĩndĩ mĩthenya ĩla mĩvĩtu ndĩkatalwa, nĩkwĩthĩwa kwĩvatha kwake nĩ kũvukye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
